#: ../../api/flowing.composables.rst:2
msgid "flowing.composables package"
msgstr "flowing.composables package"

#: flowing.composables:1 of
msgid "flowing.composables —— 应用层 Composable：纯函数式能力注入。"
msgstr "flowing.composables —— application-layer Composables: pure function-style capability injection."

#: flowing.composables:4 flowing.composables.compact:4
#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:4
#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:4 flowing.composables.reminder:4
#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:4
#: flowing.composables.retry:4 flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:4 of
msgid "功能介绍"
msgstr "Overview"

#: flowing.composables:5 of
msgid ""
"Composable 是三层架构中的应用层：普通 Python 函数（命名约定 ``use_xxx(agent, ...)``），在 Agent "
"的 ``setup()`` 中被调用，为这一个 Agent 实例注册钩子 handler 或绑定实例属性。内置四个： "
":func:`use_retry` （:mod:`flowing.composables.retry`，LLM 调用失败退避 "
"重试）、:func:`use_compact` 与 :func:`use_auto_compact` "
"（:mod:`flowing.composables.compact`，上下文占用超阈值自动压缩—— "
"前者请求后全量换链，后者请求前头尾保留，二选一）与 :func:`use_system_reminder` "
"（:mod:`flowing.composables.reminder`，每回合注入系统提醒）。场景类 "
"Composable（``use_logging`` / ``use_guardrail`` 等）属应用代码，框架 不预留符号。"
msgstr ""
"Composables are the application layer of the three-tier architecture: plain Python functions (naming "
"convention ``use_xxx(agent, ...)``) called inside an Agent's ``setup()`` to register hook handlers or bind "
"instance attributes for that one Agent instance. Four are builtin: :func:`use_retry` "
"(:mod:`flowing.composables.retry`, backoff retry on LLM call failure), :func:`use_compact` and "
":func:`use_auto_compact` (:mod:`flowing.composables.compact`, automatic compaction when context usage "
"exceeds a threshold — the former swaps in a full new chain after a request, the latter preserves head and "
"tail before a request; choose one) and :func:`use_system_reminder` "
"(:mod:`flowing.composables.reminder`, injects a system reminder each turn). Scenario-oriented "
"Composables (``use_logging`` / ``use_guardrail``, etc.) belong to application code; the framework "
"reserves no symbols for them."

#: flowing.composables:17 of
msgid ""
"Composable 只做「挂载」：注册钩子 handler、绑定实例属性；不修改框架 "
"核心状态。本包不提供插件（阶段一）能力：不做全局注册、不经过 ``runtime.install()``、自身也没有 "
"``install()``——调用即生效，作用域严格 限于传入的那一个 Agent 实例。"
msgstr ""
"A Composable only \"mounts\": it registers hook handlers and binds instance attributes; it does not modify "
"framework core state. This package provides no plugin (stage one) capability: no global registration, no "
"``runtime.install()``, and no ``install()`` of its own — calling takes effect immediately, and the scope "
"is strictly limited to the one Agent instance passed in."

#: flowing.composables:23 flowing.composables.compact:59
#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:19
#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:21 flowing.composables.reminder:36
#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:16
