msgid "使用示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: flowing.composables:24 of
msgid "典型组合（手写 Agent 子类的 ``setup()`` 中按需启用）："
msgstr "A typical combination (enable as needed in a hand-written Agent subclass's ``setup()``):"

#: flowing.composables:40 flowing.composables.compact:70
#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:29
#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:39 flowing.composables.reminder:47
#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:31
#: flowing.composables.retry:55 flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:42 of
msgid "行为要点"
msgstr "Key Behaviors"

#: flowing.composables:41 of
msgid ""
"启用方式：双层启用的阶段二——``use_xxx(self)`` 在 ``setup()`` 中按 实例启用（恢复时 ``setup()`` "
"在新实例上执行，钩子注册表随实例重建， 天然不叠加）；未调用 ``use_xxx`` 的 Agent 不持有任何相关 handler 与 "
"状态——「没启用」是「代码路径从没存在过」，不是「被跳过」，零开销。"
msgstr ""
"How to enable: stage two of two-layer enabling — ``use_xxx(self)`` is called in ``setup()`` to enable "
"per instance (on recovery ``setup()`` runs on the new instance and the hook registry is rebuilt with it, "
"so nothing stacks up naturally); an Agent that never calls ``use_xxx`` holds no related handlers or state "
"— \"not enabled\" means \"the code path never existed\", not \"skipped\", with zero overhead."

#: flowing.composables:45 of
msgid ""
"同步 / async 形态：由内部是否确需 ``await`` 决定——纯注册型 Composable 写成同步 ``def`` "
"（本包三个均为同步），调用点不需要 ``await``；需要真实等待（退避 sleep、副线查询）的 handler 才是异步 函数。"
msgstr ""
"Sync / async form: decided by whether the internals genuinely need ``await`` — pure registration-type "
"Composables are written as synchronous ``def`` (all three in this package are synchronous), so call sites "
"need no ``await``; only handlers that truly wait (backoff sleep, side-channel queries) are async functions."

#: flowing.composables:49 of
msgid "无排序约束：``setup()`` 中调用顺序决定最终结果，后注册的 handler 排在链尾执行。"
msgstr "No ordering constraint: call order in ``setup()`` determines the final result; handlers registered later run at the tail of the chain."

#: flowing.composables:51 of
msgid ""
"本包三个 Composable 均不做幂等去重：重复调用按注册语义各自叠加一组 handler（允许以不同参数多次启用）；整组替换用 "
"``remove_by_owner()`` （参数取各子模块注册面清单中的 ``by`` 值） 移除默认 handler 后自注册。"
msgstr ""
"None of the three Composables in this package does idempotent deduplication: repeated calls each stack "
"their own set of handlers per registration semantics (enabling multiple times with different parameters is "
"allowed); to replace a whole set, use ``remove_by_owner()`` (the argument is the ``by`` value from each "
"submodule's registration inventory) to remove the default handlers, then register your own."

#: flowing.composables:55 of
msgid "注册的资源、声明的钩子点与挂载的钩子：见各子模块 docstring 的 「注册面清单」。"
msgstr "Registered resources, declared hook points, and mounted hooks: see the \"Registration Inventory\" in each submodule's docstring."

#: flowing.composables:60 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins` —— 阶段一插件层（跨 Agent / 进程级能力）。 "
":class:`flowing.hooks.HookRegistry` —— Composable 的主要挂载面。"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins` —— the stage-one plugin layer (cross-Agent / process-level capabilities). "
":class:`flowing.hooks.HookRegistry` —— the main mounting surface for Composables."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:1 of
msgid "为单个 Agent 实例启用 LLM 调用失败的重试策略（可选、非默认）。"
msgstr "Enable a retry policy for LLM call failures on a single Agent instance (optional, non-default)."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:5 of
msgid ""
"在 ``agent.hooks.on_provider_error`` 上注册一个重试决策 handler "
"（``by=\"retry\"``），并配套注册一个 ``before_turn`` 归零 handler 用于在每个逻辑 Turn "
"开始时重置重试计数。启用后，该 Agent 的 LLM 调用抛出可重试类异常时，决策 handler 按参数指定的退避模型等待一段 "
"时间（期间不调用 LLM），再在同一回合内重发调用，直至成功或达到 ``max_retries`` 上限；抛出不可重试类异常或未知异常时不做重试，"
" 本回合以错误结局终止（Agent 存活）。"
msgstr ""
"Registers a retry-decision handler (``by=\"retry\"``) on ``agent.hooks.on_provider_error``, together "
"with a ``before_turn`` reset handler that resets the retry counter at the start of each logical Turn. Once "
"enabled, when this Agent's LLM call raises a retryable exception, the decision handler waits according to "
"the backoff model given by the parameters (no LLM call during the wait), then re-issues the call within "
"the same turn, until success or the ``max_retries`` limit; for non-retryable or unknown exceptions it does "
"not retry, and the turn terminates with an error outcome (the Agent survives)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:17
#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:12
#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:13 of
msgid "本函数是双层启用的阶段二入口，只能在 ``setup()`` （或实例存活期内 的任意代码）中对已完成初始化的实例调用。"
msgstr "This function is the stage-two entry point of two-layer enabling; it may only be called in ``setup()`` (or any code during the instance's lifetime) on a fully initialized instance."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:43 of
msgid "注册的两个 handler（都经 ``by=\"retry\"`` 定位与移除）："
msgstr "The two registered handlers (both located and removed via ``by=\"retry\"``):"

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:45 of
msgid "``before_turn`` 归零 handler：每个逻辑 Turn 开始时把重试计数重置 为 0（value 原样透传，纯观察不干预）。"
msgstr "``before_turn`` reset handler: resets the retry counter to 0 at the start of each logical Turn (the value passes through unchanged; pure observation, no intervention)."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:47 of
msgid "``on_provider_error`` 决策 handler：见下「重试决策」。"
msgstr "``on_provider_error`` decision handler: see \"Retry Decision\" below."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:64
#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:49 of
msgid "参数语义："
msgstr "Parameter semantics:"

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:51 of
msgid ""
"``max_retries``：单个逻辑 Turn 内允许的最大重试次数，``>= 0``。 计数从 1 起：首次失败为第 1 次尝试，只有 "
"``attempt <= max_retries`` 才放行重试，因此默认值 3 表示「初始调用 + 至多 3 次重试」至多 4 次 LLM "
"调用。``max_retries=0`` 合法：首次失败即放弃，等价于不 重试（与不调用的差别仅在于多了一次空分发）。"
msgstr ""
"``max_retries``: the maximum number of retries allowed within a single logical Turn, ``>= 0``. Counting "
"starts at 1: the first failure is attempt 1, and a retry is only allowed when ``attempt <= max_retries``, "
"so the default 3 means \"initial call + at most 3 retries\", i.e. at most 4 LLM calls. ``max_retries=0`` "
"is valid: give up on the first failure, equivalent to not retrying (the only difference from not calling "
"this function is one extra empty dispatch)."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:56 of
msgid ""
"``base_delay``：退避基准秒数，``>= 0``；为 0 时不等待直接重试。 ``backoff=\"fixed\"`` "
"时即每次的等待时长。"
msgstr ""
"``base_delay``: the base backoff delay in seconds, ``>= 0``; when 0, retry immediately without waiting. "
"With ``backoff=\"fixed\"`` this is the wait duration for every retry."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:58 of
msgid "``backoff``：退避模型，仅接受 ``\"exponential\"`` （默认）或 ``\"fixed\"``。"
msgstr "``backoff``: the backoff model; accepts only ``\"exponential\"`` (default) or ``\"fixed\"``."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:61 of
msgid "重试决策（决策 handler 收到 ``ProviderErrorContext`` 时）："
msgstr "Retry decision (when the decision handler receives a ``ProviderErrorContext``):"

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:63 of
msgid ""
"``ctx.error`` 属于 :data:`NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS`，或不在 "
":data:`RETRYABLE_ERRORS` 中（含一切未知异常）：原样返回，不等待、 不计数，``can_continue`` 保持 "
"``False``——保守原则，只对明确已知 的可重试类型放行。"
msgstr ""
"``ctx.error`` belongs to :data:`NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS`, or is not in :data:`RETRYABLE_ERRORS` (including "
"all unknown exceptions): returned unchanged — no wait, no counting, ``can_continue`` stays ``False``. "
"Conservative principle: only explicitly known retryable types are allowed through."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:67 of
msgid ""
"``ctx.error`` 属于 :data:`RETRYABLE_ERRORS`：计数加 1；若计数已 超过 ``max_retries`` "
"则放弃（原样返回，不发观测信号）；否则先置 ``ctx.can_continue = True``，等待 ``delay`` "
"秒，回合层面随后在同一 回合内重发调用。"
msgstr ""
"``ctx.error`` belongs to :data:`RETRYABLE_ERRORS`: increment the counter by 1; if the counter already "
"exceeds ``max_retries``, give up (returned unchanged, no observation signal emitted); otherwise set "
"``ctx.can_continue = True`` first, wait ``delay`` seconds, and the turn layer then re-issues the call "
"within the same turn."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:71 of
msgid ""
"延迟计算：``backoff=\"exponential\"`` 时， "
":class:`flowing.errors.RateLimitedError` 的等待时长为 ``min(base_delay * 2 ** "
"(attempt - 1), MAX_RETRY_DELAY)``，其余 三类基础设施错误（``ServerError`` / "
"``NetworkError`` / ``ProviderTimeoutError``）恒为 ``base_delay`` （瞬时基础设施故障 "
"不需要幂增长）；``backoff=\"fixed\"`` 时所有可重试错误的等待时长恒 为 "
"``base_delay``。不引入随机抖动——单机小工具定位下不存在多客户 端同步重试打爆服务端的场景，等待时长可预测、可测试；需要抖动的 "
"应用自行注册 handler。"
msgstr ""
"Delay computation: with ``backoff=\"exponential\"``, the wait for "
":class:`flowing.errors.RateLimitedError` is ``min(base_delay * 2 ** (attempt - 1), MAX_RETRY_DELAY)``, "
"while the other three infrastructure errors (``ServerError`` / ``NetworkError`` / "
"``ProviderTimeoutError``) always wait ``base_delay`` (transient infrastructure failures need no "
"exponential growth); with ``backoff=\"fixed\"`` every retryable error waits ``base_delay``. No random "
"jitter is introduced — in the single-machine small-tool positioning there is no scenario where many "
"clients retry in sync and crush the server, so wait times are predictable and testable; applications that "
"need jitter register their own handler."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:81 of
msgid ""
"重试计数：计数是 handler 闭包的内部状态，不是框架字段——回合 层面不存在重试计数状态机。计数随逻辑 Turn 边界归零（经 "
"``before_turn`` 归零 handler），同一 Turn 内的多次 ``provider_gen()`` 共享计数 "
"（失败预算不区分是哪一次调用消耗的）；不落盘、不进快照、崩溃后不 恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Retry counting: the counter is internal state of the handler closure, not a framework field — there is no "
"retry-counter state machine at the turn layer. The counter resets at logical Turn boundaries (via the "
"``before_turn`` reset handler); multiple ``provider_gen()`` calls within the same Turn share the counter "
"(the failure budget does not distinguish which call consumed it); it is not persisted, not part of "
"snapshots, and not recovered after a crash."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:87 of
msgid ""
"重试观测信号（``on_retry`` 钩子点）：每次放行重试时，在置 ``can_continue`` 之后、等待之前，以 fire-and-"
"forget 方式向 ``on_retry`` 派发一份含四个键的快照：``attempt`` / ``max_retries`` / "
"``delay`` / ``error`` （``error`` 的值是本次失败的原始异常），供 UI "
"显示「retrying...(1/10)」之类的进行态。快照发出后订阅者的返回值 "
"被忽略（观测语义，不参与决策链）；达到上限放弃重试的路径不发信号； 订阅者 异常被记录为警告，不影响重试决策。"
msgstr ""
"Retry observation signal (the ``on_retry`` hook point): each time a retry is allowed, after setting "
"``can_continue`` and before waiting, a snapshot with four keys is dispatched to ``on_retry`` in "
"fire-and-forget fashion: ``attempt`` / ``max_retries`` / ``delay`` / ``error`` (the value of ``error`` is "
"the original exception of this failure), so a UI can show progress like \"retrying...(1/10)\". Subscriber "
"return values are ignored after the snapshot is sent (observation semantics; they do not participate in "
"the decision chain); no signal is emitted on the path that gives up after reaching the limit; subscriber "
"exceptions are logged as warnings and do not affect the retry decision."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:96 of
msgid ""
"重复调用：不做幂等去重——每次调用按注册语义各自叠加一组独立的 handler（各自持有独立的计数闭包），允许以不同参数多次启用。恢复时 "
"``setup()`` 在新实例上执行，钩子注册表随实例重建，天然不叠加。"
msgstr ""
"Repeated calls: no idempotent deduplication — each call stacks its own independent set of handlers per "
"registration semantics (each holding its own counting closure); enabling multiple times with different "
"parameters is allowed. On recovery ``setup()`` runs on the new instance and the hook registry is rebuilt "
"with it, so nothing stacks up naturally."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:99 of
msgid ""
"回合中止：等待期间用户 ``cancel()`` 当前执行——等待本身不可 中断，本次等待结束后 ``can_continue=True`` "
"放行，回合层面在下一次 ``provider_gen()`` 前的检查点正常中止。取消的生效粒度是「当前这次 退避等待结束」。"
msgstr ""
"Turn cancellation: the user ``cancel()``s the current execution during the wait — the wait itself cannot "
"be interrupted; once this wait ends, ``can_continue=True`` lets it through, and the turn layer aborts "
"normally at the checkpoint before the next ``provider_gen()``. The granularity of cancellation is \"the "
"current backoff wait finishes\"."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:104 of
msgid ""
"不做什么：不修改 ``agent.model`` / ``agent.model_tag`` （「改模型 后重试」是用户自定义 handler "
"的合法写法，默认实现不做）；不产生任何 消息、不写消息级树；不做跨错误联动（如「连续限流 3 次后换策略」）。"
msgstr ""
"What it does not do: it does not modify ``agent.model`` / ``agent.model_tag`` (\"switch model then retry\" "
"is a legitimate user-defined handler pattern, but the default implementation does not do it); it produces "
"no messages and writes nothing to the message tree; it does no cross-error coordination (such as \"switch "
"strategy after 3 consecutive rate limits\")."

