#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:120 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_owner` —— 整组替换"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.lists.ManagedList.remove_by_owner` —— the entry point"

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:121 of
msgid "默认策略的入口。"
msgstr "for replacing the default policy as a whole."

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:122 of
msgid ":data:`RETRYABLE_ERRORS` / :data:`NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS` ——"
msgstr ":data:`RETRYABLE_ERRORS` / :data:`NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS` ——"

#: flowing.composables.retry.use_retry:123 of
msgid "默认策略的错误分类清单。"
msgstr "the default policy's error classification lists."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:1 of
msgid "为单个 Agent 实例启用「上下文超阈值自动压缩」策略（可选、非默认）。"
msgstr "Enable the \"auto-compact when context exceeds a threshold\" policy on a single Agent instance (optional, non-default)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:5 of
msgid "依次完成三件事（都经 ``by=\"compact\"`` 定位与移除）："
msgstr "Does three things in sequence (all located and removed via ``by=\"compact\"``):"

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:7 of
msgid ""
"声明 ``on_compact`` 钩子点（同名同 ``by`` 幂等）——压缩观测 / 拦截点，value 为 "
":class:`flowing.context.ContextUsageEstimate`， handler 可 ``raise "
"Intercepted`` 取消本次压缩；"
msgstr ""
"declares the ``on_compact`` hook point (idempotent for the same name and ``by``) — the compaction "
"observation / interception point, whose value is :class:`flowing.context.ContextUsageEstimate`; a handler "
"may ``raise Intercepted`` to cancel this compaction;"

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:10 of
msgid ""
"``compact_prompt`` 缺省绑定——Agent 上尚无该属性（含类属性）时， 把 "
"``Parsable(DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT)`` 绑为实例属性；开发者已 定义的优先，不覆盖；"
msgstr ""
"default binding of ``compact_prompt`` — when the Agent does not yet have that attribute (including as a "
"class attribute), binds ``Parsable(DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT)`` as an instance attribute; a developer-defined "
"value takes precedence and is not overwritten;"

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:13 of
msgid ""
"在 ``agent.hooks.after_provider_gen[\"_turn\"]`` 上注册检测与换链 "
"handler（``by=\"compact\"``，pattern 注册：``match_on=\"by\"``， 字面量 "
"``\"_turn\"`` 精确匹配主回合来源）。"
msgstr ""
"registers the detection-and-chain-swap handler on ``agent.hooks.after_provider_gen[\"_turn\"]`` "
"(``by=\"compact\"``, pattern registration: ``match_on=\"by\"``, the literal ``\"_turn\"`` exactly matches "
"the main-turn source)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:40 of
msgid "检测与压缩序列（主回合响应经 ``after_provider_gen`` 到达后，handler 一次调用内完成）："
msgstr "Detection and compaction sequence (after the main-turn response arrives via ``after_provider_gen``, completed within one handler call):"

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:43 of
msgid ""
"检测：调用 ``estimate_context_tokens()`` 取 ``usage_ratio``；比率 ``> threshold`` "
"才进入压缩序列（严格大于）。``usage_ratio is None`` （模型未声明 "
"``context_window``）时不动作、永不触发。"
msgstr ""
"Detection: call ``estimate_context_tokens()`` to get ``usage_ratio``; the compaction sequence is entered "
"only when the ratio is ``> threshold`` (strictly greater). When ``usage_ratio is None`` (the model does "
"not declare ``context_window``), nothing happens and it never triggers."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:46 of
msgid ""
"拦截：先向 ``on_compact`` 派发本次估计值；任一 handler ``raise Intercepted`` 则本次压缩取消——不调"
" ``side_query``、不建 新根、不换链，本回合照常继续。"
msgstr ""
"Interception: first dispatch this estimate to ``on_compact``; if any handler does ``raise Intercepted``, "
"this compaction is cancelled — no ``side_query``, no new root, no chain swap; the turn continues normally."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:49 of
msgid ""
"摘要：经 ``side_query`` 让模型基于当前完整上下文产出交接摘要 （指令为 ``compact_prompt`` 经 Parsable"
" 模板求值（resolve）后的 文本；副线调用不挂树、不落盘，来源标记为 ``by=\"_side\"``）。"
msgstr ""
"Summarization: via ``side_query``, the model produces a handoff summary based on the current full context "
"(the instruction is the text of ``compact_prompt`` after Parsable template resolution; the side-channel "
"call is not attached to the tree and not persisted, with source marked ``by=\"_side\"``)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:52 of
msgid ""
"换链：摘要非空时把它作为新根挂树（``parent_id is None``、 "
"``kind=SYSTEM``、``source=\"compact\"``），再 ``fork`` 到新根。旧链 物理完整保留。"
msgstr ""
"Chain swap: when the summary is non-empty, attach it to the tree as a new root (``parent_id is None``, "
"``kind=SYSTEM``, ``source=\"compact\"``), then ``fork`` to the new root. The old chain is physically kept "
"intact."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:55 of
msgid ""
"摘要失败（``side_query`` 抛异常或返回空文本）→ 不换链、异常不外 抛、本回合正常收尾；下一次超阈值的主回合 "
"``provider_gen`` 后再试 ——两次尝试之间至少隔着一次主循环调用，不会热循环。"
msgstr ""
"Summary failure (``side_query`` raises or returns empty text) → no chain swap, the exception is not "
"re-raised, and the turn finishes normally; retry after the next main-turn ``provider_gen`` that exceeds "
"the threshold — two attempts are separated by at least one main-loop call, so there is no hot loop."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:58 of
msgid "``before_fork`` 被拦截 → 新根已落盘而 head 未切：本次压缩白做 一次（安全，下次超阈值重来）。"
msgstr "``before_fork`` intercepted → the new root is persisted but head is not switched: this compaction is wasted (safe; it retries the next time the threshold is exceeded)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:61 of
msgid "检测口径：handler 运行时本轮响应尚未挂树，估计值不含它——比率按 上一锚点口径，略滞后一条消息。"
msgstr "Detection basis: when the handler runs, this turn's response has not yet been attached to the tree and the estimate does not include it — the ratio follows the previous anchor's basis, lagging by one message."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:66 of
msgid ""
"``threshold``：触发阈值，``usage_ratio`` 严格大于它时启动压缩； 合法区间 ``0 < threshold <= "
"1.0`` （``usage_ratio`` 不做上限截断， ``> 1.0`` 是合法的溢出信号，``threshold=1.0`` "
"即「只在溢出后压 缩」）。区间外的值抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr ""
"``threshold``: the trigger threshold; compaction starts when ``usage_ratio`` is strictly greater than it; "
"the valid range is ``0 < threshold <= 1.0`` (``usage_ratio`` is not clamped above; ``> 1.0`` is a "
"legitimate overflow signal, and ``threshold=1.0`` means \"compact only after overflow\"). Values outside "
"the range raise ``ValueError``."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:71 of
msgid ""
"重复调用：不做幂等去重——每次调用按注册语义各自叠加一个检测 handler （各自闭包持有独立的 "
"``threshold``），允许以不同参数多次启用。恢复 时 ``setup()`` 在新实例上执行，钩子注册表随实例重建，天然不叠加。"
msgstr ""
"Repeated calls: no idempotent deduplication — each call stacks its own detection handler per registration "
"semantics (each closure holds its own ``threshold``); enabling multiple times with different parameters is "
"allowed. On recovery ``setup()`` runs on the new instance and the hook registry is rebuilt with it, so "
"nothing stacks up naturally."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:75 of
msgid "并发：同一 Agent 的回合串行执行（单工作循环 Task），handler 在回合 内同步段执行，无并发读写。"
msgstr "Concurrency: turns of the same Agent execute serially (a single work-loop Task); the handler runs in the synchronous segment within a turn, with no concurrent reads or writes."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:78 of
msgid "不做什么：不修改 ``agent.model``、不动消息队列、不 abort 回合、不 注册工具、不 provide 值、不持久化任何状态。"
msgstr "What it does not do: it does not modify ``agent.model``, does not touch the message queue, does not abort the turn, does not register tools, does not provide values, and does not persist any state."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:72
#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:82 of
msgid "触发阈值（``usage_ratio`` 严格大于它时启动压缩）， ``0 < threshold <= 1.0``，默认 ``0.8``。"
msgstr "The trigger threshold (compaction starts when ``usage_ratio`` is strictly greater than it), ``0 < threshold <= 1.0``, default ``0.8``."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:84 of
msgid "``threshold`` 不在 ``(0, 1.0]`` 区间（于注册任何 handler 之前抛出）。"
msgstr "``threshold`` is not in the ``(0, 1.0]`` range (raised before any handler is registered)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_compact:89 of
msgid ""
":data:`DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT` —— 缺省压缩指令。 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.side_query` —— 摘要取用的副线通道。 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.fork` —— 换链的视角切换通道。"
msgstr ""
":data:`DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT` —— the default compaction instruction. "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.side_query` —— the side-channel used for summarization. "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.fork` —— the view-switching channel for the chain swap."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:1 of
msgid "为单个 Agent 实例启用「请求前头尾保留式自动压缩」策略（可选、非默认）。"
msgstr "Enable the \"pre-request head-and-tail preserving auto-compaction\" policy on a single Agent instance (optional, non-default)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:5 of
msgid ""
"在 ``before_provider_gen`` 上注册检测与压缩 handler "
"（``by=\"auto_compact\"``）：每次主回合 LLM 请求发出**之前**检查上下文 占用，超过 ``threshold`` "
"时在同一 handler 调用内完成压缩——保留链 头部（≤ ``head_tokens``）与尾部（≤ "
"``tail_tokens``）的原始消息， 中段压缩为一条「用户指令汇编 + 交接摘要」消息，从前缀末条开分支、 后缀深拷贝拼接，再 "
"``fork`` 换链；本次请求直接携带压缩后的上下文 发出（handler 整体改写 ``Context``）。"
msgstr ""
"Registers a detection-and-compaction handler on ``before_provider_gen`` (``by=\"auto_compact\"``): "
"**before** each main-turn LLM request is sent, it checks context usage; when it exceeds ``threshold``, "
"compaction completes within the same handler call — the original messages at the chain head "
"(≤ ``head_tokens``) and tail (≤ ``tail_tokens``) are preserved, the middle section is compacted into one "
"\"user-instruction digest + handoff summary\" message, branched off the last message of the prefix with the "
"suffix deep-copied and appended, then ``fork`` swaps the chain; this request is sent directly carrying the "
"compacted context (the handler rewrites the whole ``Context``)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:13 of
msgid ""
"与 :func:`use_compact` 的区别：use_compact 在请求**后**触发、全量 "
"摘要换新根（工作现场丢失）；本函数在请求**前**触发、头尾保留（开场 指令与最近的工具调用现场原样留在上下文里）。两者并存但应二选一—— "
"同时启用会在不同触发点各自动作。"
msgstr ""
"Difference from :func:`use_compact`: use_compact triggers **after** the request and swaps in a full new "
"root from a summary (the working scene is lost); this function triggers **before** the request and "
"preserves head and tail (the opening instructions and the latest tool-call scene stay in the context as "
"they are). The two can coexist but you should choose one — enabling both makes each act at its own "
"trigger point."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:30 of
msgid ""
"主回合判定：handler 入口读 ``context.messages`` 末条消息——主回合 请求的末条消息必在消息树内（入队 / "
"挂树时已铸自增 id）；副线 ``side_query`` 自组装散装 Context（不进树），据此放行。递归防护 零状态（压缩自身的 "
"side_query 也被同一规则放行）。"
msgstr ""
"Main-turn determination: on entry the handler reads the last message of ``context.messages`` — the last "
"message of a main-turn request is necessarily inside the message tree (an auto-increment id is minted at "
"enqueue / attach time); a side-channel ``side_query`` assembles a loose Context itself (not in the tree) "
"and is let through accordingly. Recursion protection is stateless (the compaction's own side_query is also "
"let through by the same rule)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:34 of
msgid ""
"触发条件：``estimate_context_tokens().usage_ratio > threshold`` "
"（严格大于）；``usage_ratio is None``（模型未声明 context_window） 时永不触发。"
msgstr ""
"Trigger condition: ``estimate_context_tokens().usage_ratio > threshold`` (strictly greater); it never "
"triggers when ``usage_ratio is None`` (the model does not declare context_window)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:37 of
msgid ""
"拦截：压缩前 dispatch ``on_compact``（value 为 "
":class:`flowing.context.ContextUsageEstimate`）；任一 handler ``raise "
"Intercepted`` 则本次取消。"
msgstr ""
"Interception: dispatch ``on_compact`` before compacting (value is "
":class:`flowing.context.ContextUsageEstimate`); if any handler does ``raise Intercepted``, this compaction "
"is cancelled."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:40 of
msgid ""
"切割规则：前缀从链头累计 token 取 ≤ ``head_tokens`` 的最长前缀， 切割点只允许落在 PROVIDER "
"消息的**上边界**（ToolCallBlock/TOOL 配对天然完整）；后缀从链尾同规则取 ≤ ``tail_tokens``，切割点同样 在"
" PROVIDER 上边界——链尾的非 PROVIDER 连续段（本轮新指令 / 刚落盘 的 TOOL 结果）始终保留，含 TOOL 时连同其 "
"PROVIDER 配对锚一起保留 （配对完整优先于预算）；与前缀重叠时收缩后缀（前缀优先）。触发点在请求 之前，上一轮的工具配对均已闭合挂树。"
msgstr ""
"Cutting rules: the prefix takes the longest prefix from the chain head whose cumulative tokens are "
"≤ ``head_tokens``, and the cut point may only land on the **upper boundary** of a PROVIDER message "
"(ToolCallBlock/TOOL pairs stay naturally intact); the suffix takes ≤ ``tail_tokens`` from the chain tail "
"under the same rule, with the cut point likewise on a PROVIDER upper boundary — the non-PROVIDER "
"contiguous segment at the chain tail (this turn's new instruction / freshly persisted TOOL results) is "
"always preserved, and when it contains TOOL, its PROVIDER pairing anchor is preserved with it (pair "
"integrity takes priority over budget); when it overlaps the prefix, the suffix shrinks (prefix takes "
"priority). The trigger point is before the request, so the previous turn's tool pairs are already closed "
"and attached to the tree."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:47 of
msgid ""
"中段处理：前后缀之间从前数累计 ≤ ``user_instruction_tokens`` 的 USER 消息，紧凑格式化（一个小标题 + 各条 "
"``---`` 分隔），与 ``side_query`` 产出的交接摘要合并为一条 ``SYSTEM`` 消息 "
"（``source=\"auto_compact\"``），经 ``chain.branch`` 挂到前缀末条 之下。内置 prompt "
"与格式化文本一律英文。"
msgstr ""
"Middle-section handling: among the messages between prefix and suffix, the USER messages whose cumulative "
"count from the front is ≤ ``user_instruction_tokens`` are compactly formatted (one small heading + each "
"entry separated by ``---``) and merged with the handoff summary produced by ``side_query`` into a single "
"``SYSTEM`` message (``source=\"auto_compact\"``), attached below the last message of the prefix via "
"``chain.branch``. The builtin prompt and formatting text are always in English."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:52 of
msgid ""
"后缀拼接：逐条 ``copy.deepcopy`` 后置 ``id=None`` / ``parent_id=None``，链式 "
"``branch`` 拼接（挂树自动铸新 id，与旧 节点无冲突）；旧链物理完整保留（append-only）。"
msgstr ""
"Suffix splicing: each message is ``copy.deepcopy``-ed, then ``id=None`` / ``parent_id=None`` are set, and "
"they are spliced via chained ``branch`` calls (attaching to the tree automatically mints new ids, with no "
"conflict against old nodes); the old chain is physically kept intact (append-only)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:55 of
msgid ""
"换链：``fork`` 到后缀末条新 id（无后缀则到压缩消息）； ``before_fork`` 被拦截 → 新分支已落盘而 head "
"未切（白压一次， 安全），本次请求携原上下文发出。"
msgstr ""
"Chain swap: ``fork`` to the new id of the last suffix message (or to the compaction message if there is no "
"suffix); if ``before_fork`` is intercepted → the new branch is persisted but head is not switched (one "
"wasted compaction, safe), and this request is sent with the original context."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:58 of
msgid "摘要失败（``side_query`` 异常或返回空文本）→ 不换链、异常不外 抛、本次请求照常发出；下一次请求前再试，不会热循环。"
msgstr "Summary failure (``side_query`` raises or returns empty text) → no chain swap, the exception is not re-raised, and this request is sent as usual; it retries before the next request, with no hot loop."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:60 of
msgid ""
"边界情形：链太短（前缀 + 后缀已覆盖全链、无中段）→ 跳过；压缩后 仍超窗 → 本次请求照常发出，由 "
":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError` 通道兜底。"
msgstr ""
"Edge cases: chain too short (prefix + suffix already cover the whole chain, no middle section) → skip; "
"still over the window after compaction → this request is sent as usual, with the "
":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError` channel as the fallback."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:64 of
msgid ""
"重复调用：不做幂等去重——每次调用各自叠加一个 handler（闭包持有 独立参数）。恢复时 ``setup()`` "
"在新实例上执行，钩子注册表随实例 重建，天然不叠加。``remove_by_owner(\"auto_compact\")`` 可整组移除。"
msgstr ""
"Repeated calls: no idempotent deduplication — each call stacks its own handler (the closure holds "
"independent parameters). On recovery ``setup()`` runs on the new instance and the hook registry is rebuilt "
"with it, so nothing stacks up naturally. ``remove_by_owner(\"auto_compact\")`` removes the whole set."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:68 of
msgid ""
"不做什么：不修改 ``agent.model``、不动消息队列、不 abort 回合、不 "
"注册工具、不持久化任何压缩状态（消息树变更本身是常规落盘）。"
msgstr ""
"What it does not do: it does not modify ``agent.model``, does not touch the message queue, does not abort "
"the turn, does not register tools, and does not persist any compaction state (message-tree changes are "
"themselves normal persistence)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:74 of
msgid "尾部保留的 token 上限，``>= 0``，默认 ``20_000``。"
msgstr "The token cap for the preserved tail, ``>= 0``, default ``20_000``."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:75 of
msgid "头部保留的 token 上限，``>= 0``，默认 ``10_000``。"
msgstr "The token cap for the preserved head, ``>= 0``, default ``10_000``."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:76 of
msgid "中段用户指令汇编的 token 上限， ``>= 0``，默认 ``2_000``。"
msgstr "The token cap for the middle-section user-instruction digest, ``>= 0``, default ``2_000``."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:78 of
msgid "参数越界（于注册任何 handler 之前抛出）。"
msgstr "Parameter out of range (raised before any handler is registered)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:82 of
msgid ""
":func:`use_compact` —— 请求后全量换链的同族策略（二选一）。 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.estimate_context_tokens` —— 阈值检测的"
msgstr ""
":func:`use_compact` —— the sibling policy that fully swaps the chain after a request (choose one). "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.estimate_context_tokens` —— the data source"

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:84 of
msgid "数据源。"
msgstr "for threshold detection."

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:85 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens` —— 单条消息的"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens` —— the estimation"

#: flowing.composables.compact.use_auto_compact:86 of
msgid "估算口径。"
msgstr "basis for a single message."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:1 of
msgid "为单个 Agent 实例启用「每回合注入系统提醒」策略（可选、非默认）。"
msgstr "Enable the \"inject a system reminder each turn\" policy on a single Agent instance (optional, non-default)."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:5 of
msgid ""
"注册 ``by=\"system-reminder\"`` 的 ``before_turn`` 注入 handler：每个 逻辑 Turn "
"开始时，把当前可见的提醒内容压缩为一条 ``Message(kind=EVENT, source=\"system-reminder\", "
"...)`` 附加进 ``pending_messages`` 末尾（排在触发消息之后），随批次挂树并持久化。 ``clean=True`` "
"时再注册 ``after_turn`` 清理 handler（同 ``by``）， 每回合收尾按 ``tags`` 擦除本回合注入的提醒。"
msgstr ""
"Registers a ``before_turn`` injection handler with ``by=\"system-reminder\"``: at the start of each "
"logical Turn, it compresses the currently visible reminder contents into one ``Message(kind=EVENT, "
"source=\"system-reminder\", ...)`` and appends it to the end of ``pending_messages`` (after the triggering "
"message), attaching to the tree and persisting along with the batch. With ``clean=True`` it additionally "
"registers an ``after_turn`` cleanup handler (same ``by``) that erases this turn's injected reminders by "
"``tags`` at the end of each turn."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:32 of
msgid ""
"``contents``：提醒内容清单，各项为 ``(agent) -> str`` 回调或静态 "
"字符串，每次注入现场求值；空字符串条目剔除；清单为空（含缺省 ``None``）或全部条目为空串时本回合不注入。"
msgstr ""
"``contents``: the list of reminder contents; each item is an ``(agent) -> str`` callback or a static "
"string, evaluated on the spot at each injection; empty-string entries are dropped; when the list is empty "
"(including the default ``None``) or all entries are empty strings, nothing is injected this turn."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:35 of
msgid ""
"注入条件：距上次注入后新增消息数 ``>= message_interval`` 且距上次 注入的墙钟间隔 ``>= "
"time_interval`` （秒）——两者是与关系，任一不 满足即跳过；两者均为 0（默认）时每回合都注入；首次注入不受间隔 "
"限制。间隔判定状态是闭包内部状态，纯运行期，不落盘、不进状态袋。"
msgstr ""
"Injection condition: the number of new messages since the last injection is ``>= message_interval`` AND "
"the wall-clock interval since the last injection is ``>= time_interval`` (seconds) — the two are "
"conjunctive; if either is unmet, injection is skipped; when both are 0 (default), injection happens every "
"turn; the first injection is not subject to the interval limits. The interval-decision state is closure-"
"internal state, purely runtime — not persisted, not in the state bag."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:39 of
msgid ""
"消息计数口径：以消息级树的总结点数（``len(agent._messages)``）为 水位——``before_turn`` 触发时 "
"``turn.message_ids`` 恒为空（本回合 批次尚未挂树），无法用回合消息列表计数。"
msgstr ""
"Message counting basis: the watermark is the total node count of the message tree "
"(``len(agent._messages)``) — when ``before_turn`` fires, ``turn.message_ids`` is always empty (this "
"turn's batch has not been attached to the tree yet), so the turn's message list cannot be used for "
"counting."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:42 of
msgid "``clean=True`` 的代价与边界：每回合收尾擦除（写盘量约翻倍）； 清理后历史回放中该信息丢失（崩溃恢复后那条提醒已被删除）。"
msgstr "The cost and boundary of ``clean=True``: erasure at the end of each turn (write volume roughly doubles); after cleanup the information is lost from history replay (after crash recovery that reminder has been deleted)."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:44 of
msgid "与批次同生共死：``before_turn`` 被 ``Intercepted`` 阻断时整个批次 丢弃、不落盘，提醒随之不注入。"
msgstr "Living and dying with the batch: when ``before_turn`` is blocked by ``Intercepted``, the whole batch is discarded without persistence, and the reminder is not injected along with it."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:46 of
msgid ""
"重复调用：不做幂等去重——每次调用各叠加一组独立的 handler（各自 持有独立的间隔状态闭包），允许以不同参数多次启用。恢复时 "
"``setup()`` 在新实例上执行，钩子注册表随实例重建，天然不叠加。"
msgstr ""
"Repeated calls: no idempotent deduplication — each call stacks its own independent set of handlers (each "
"holding its own interval-state closure); enabling multiple times with different parameters is allowed. On "
"recovery ``setup()`` runs on the new instance and the hook registry is rebuilt with it, so nothing stacks "
"up naturally."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:48 of
msgid "不做什么：不注册模板全局函数、不改 prompt 块、不修改 ``agent.model``、不持久化任何状态。"
msgstr "What it does not do: it does not register template global functions, does not change prompt blocks, does not modify ``agent.model``, and does not persist any state."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:52 of
msgid "提醒内容清单（``(agent) -> str`` 回调或静态字符串）； 缺省 ``None`` 视为空清单。"
msgstr "The list of reminder contents (``(agent) -> str`` callbacks or static strings); the default ``None`` is treated as an empty list."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:54 of
msgid ""
"为 ``True`` 时每回合收尾按 ``tags`` 擦除本回合注入的 提醒；为 ``False`` "
"（默认）时提醒留在树上（持久化、崩溃可恢复）。"
msgstr ""
"When ``True``, this turn's injected reminders are erased by ``tags`` at the end of each turn; when "
"``False`` (default), the reminders stay on the tree (persisted, recoverable after a crash)."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:56 of
msgid "距上次注入后新增消息数达到该值才再次注入， ``>= 0``，默认 ``0`` （每回合都注入）。"
msgstr "Inject again only when the number of new messages since the last injection reaches this value, ``>= 0``, default ``0`` (inject every turn)."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:58 of
msgid "距上次注入的墙钟间隔（秒）达到该值才再次注入， ``>= 0``，默认 ``0`` （不限）。"
msgstr "Inject again only when the wall-clock interval (seconds) since the last injection reaches this value, ``>= 0``, default ``0`` (unlimited)."

#: flowing.composables.reminder.use_system_reminder:63 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` —— ``pending_messages`` 附加式 注入的载体。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` —— the carrier of ``pending_messages`` append-style injection."

#: ../../api/flowing.composables.rst:10
msgid "Submodules"
msgstr "Submodules"

#: ../../api/flowing.composables.rst:13
msgid "flowing.composables.compact module"
msgstr "flowing.composables.compact module"

#: flowing.composables.compact:1 of
msgid "flowing.composables.compact —— 内置上下文压缩 Composable（可选、非默认）。"
msgstr "flowing.composables.compact —— builtin context-compaction Composables (optional, non-default)."

#: flowing.composables.compact:5 of
msgid "本模块提供两个内置上下文压缩 Composable（可选、非默认；二选一）："
msgstr "This module provides two builtin context-compaction Composables (optional, non-default; choose one):"

#: flowing.composables.compact:7 of
msgid ""
"``use_compact()`` —— 请求**后**触发（``after_provider_gen[\"_turn\"]``）， "
"全量摘要换新根：让模型把当前对话压缩为交接摘要，摘要作为新根开新链， 旧链整体成为历史。"
msgstr ""
"``use_compact()`` —— triggers **after** the request (``after_provider_gen[\"_turn\"]``), full-summary "
"swap to a new root: the model compresses the current conversation into a handoff summary, the summary "
"starts a new chain as the new root, and the old chain becomes history as a whole."

#: flowing.composables.compact:10 of
msgid ""
"``use_auto_compact()`` —— 请求**前**触发（``before_provider_gen``）， "
"头尾保留式压缩：保留链头（≤ ``head_tokens``）与链尾（≤ ``tail_tokens``） 的原始消息，中段压缩为「用户指令汇编 "
"+ 交接摘要」一条消息，开分支 换链后本次请求直接携压缩后上下文发出。"
msgstr ""
"``use_auto_compact()`` —— triggers **before** the request (``before_provider_gen``), head-and-tail "
"preserving compaction: the original messages at the chain head (≤ ``head_tokens``) and tail "
"(≤ ``tail_tokens``) are preserved, the middle section is compacted into one \"user-instruction digest + "
"handoff summary\" message, and after branching and swapping the chain, this request is sent directly "
"carrying the compacted context."

#: flowing.composables.compact:15 of
msgid ""
"``use_compact()`` 的压缩序列：主回合 LLM 调用成功返回后检查 "
"``estimate_context_tokens().usage_ratio``，超阈值时在同一 handler 调用内 依次——经 "
"``side_query`` 副线让模型基于当前完整上下文产出交接摘要 （不挂树、不落盘）→ 摘要作为新的 ``SYSTEM`` 根消息挂树 "
"（``MessageChain.branch(None, ...)``）→ ``Agent.fork()`` 把 "
"``current_head_id`` 切到新根。旧链完整保留在消息树与 ``tree.jsonl`` "
"中成为历史，新链从摘要开始，当前回合无缝继续。"
msgstr ""
"The compaction sequence of ``use_compact()``: after the main-turn LLM call returns successfully, it checks "
"``estimate_context_tokens().usage_ratio``; when the threshold is exceeded, within the same handler call it "
"in sequence — via the ``side_query`` side channel has the model produce a handoff summary based on the "
"current full context (not attached to the tree, not persisted) → attaches the summary as a new ``SYSTEM`` "
"root message (``MessageChain.branch(None, ...)``) → ``Agent.fork()`` switches ``current_head_id`` to the "
"new root. The old chain is kept intact in the message tree and ``tree.jsonl`` as history; the new chain "
"starts from the summary, and the current turn continues seamlessly."

#: flowing.composables.compact:23 of
msgid ""
"``use_auto_compact()`` 的注册面同构：handler 挂 ``before_provider_gen`` "
"（``by=\"auto_compact\"``，普通注册——主回合/副线区分由 handler 读 ``context.messages`` "
"末条消息是否在树内完成，零状态递归防护），详见 :func:`use_auto_compact`。"
msgstr ""
"``use_auto_compact()`` has an isomorphic registration surface: the handler mounts on "
"``before_provider_gen`` (``by=\"auto_compact\"``, plain registration — the main-turn/side-channel "
"distinction is made by the handler reading whether the last message of ``context.messages`` is in the "
"tree, stateless recursion protection); see :func:`use_auto_compact` for details."

#: flowing.composables.compact:28 of
msgid ""
"本模块属应用层 / 内置 Composable：随 ``flowing`` 包发布但不自动启用， 必须由 Agent 开发者在 "
"``setup()`` 中显式调用。不调用的 Agent 不持有任何 压缩相关 handler 与状态——行为与不调用时逐字节等价。"
msgstr ""
"This module belongs to the application layer / builtin Composables: it ships with the ``flowing`` package "
"but is not enabled automatically; the Agent developer must call it explicitly in ``setup()``. An Agent "
"that never calls it holds no compaction-related handlers or state — its behavior is byte-for-byte "
"equivalent to not calling it."

#: flowing.composables.compact:32 of
msgid ""
"「何时压、压成什么样」没有唯一正确答案：阈值与摘要指令都应可整体替换， 框架核心只提供占用估计、``side_query`` "
"副线、开新根（``branch``）与 ``fork`` 四个机制，本模块提供一份可整体替换的默认策略。替换方式同 "
"``use_retry``：``remove_by_owner(\"compact\")`` 移除默认 handler 后自注册。"
msgstr ""
"There is no single correct answer to \"when to compact and into what\": both the threshold and the summary "
"instruction should be replaceable as a whole. The framework core provides only four mechanisms — usage "
"estimation, the ``side_query`` side channel, opening a new root (``branch``), and ``fork`` — and this "
"module provides one default policy replaceable as a whole. The replacement method is the same as "
"``use_retry``: remove the default handlers with ``remove_by_owner(\"compact\")`` and register your own."

#: flowing.composables.compact:38 flowing.composables.reminder:20
#: flowing.composables.retry:26 of
msgid "注册面清单"
msgstr "Registration Inventory"

#: flowing.composables.compact:39 of
msgid ""
"启用方式：仅阶段二——``setup()`` 中调用 ``use_compact(self)`` （恢复 时 ``setup()`` "
"在新实例上执行，天然不叠加）。未启用时零开销： ``after_provider_gen`` 链上无任何 ``by=\"compact\"`` "
"handler， ``use_compact`` 不会为 Agent 绑定 ``compact_prompt`` 属性， "
"``on_compact`` 钩子点不存在（访问抛 :class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`）。"
msgstr ""
"How to enable: stage two only — call ``use_compact(self)`` in ``setup()`` (on recovery ``setup()`` runs "
"on the new instance, so nothing stacks up naturally). Zero overhead when not enabled: no "
"``by=\"compact\"`` handler on the ``after_provider_gen`` chain, ``use_compact`` does not bind a "
"``compact_prompt`` attribute on the Agent, and the ``on_compact`` hook point does not exist (access raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`)."

#: flowing.composables.compact:45 of
msgid ""
"注册的资源：Agent 侧 ``compact_prompt`` 属性（缺省绑定 "
":data:`DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT`，开发者已定义时保留开发者的，见 :func:`use_compact`）；副线查询 "
"``side_query`` （``by=\"_side\"``，框架 机制，非本模块注册）。无 provide key、无工具注册、无 "
"Agent 状态键。"
msgstr ""
"Registered resources: the Agent-side ``compact_prompt`` attribute (bound by default to "
":data:`DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT`; a developer-defined value is kept, see :func:`use_compact`); the "
"side-channel query ``side_query`` (``by=\"_side\"``, a framework mechanism, not registered by this "
"module). No provide keys, no tool registrations, no Agent state keys."

#: flowing.composables.compact:49 of
msgid ""
"声明的钩子点：``on_compact`` （``by=\"compact\"``，无 ``match_on``）—— 压缩观测 / "
"拦截点，由本模块在使用处 dispatch（谁声明谁 dispatch）。"
msgstr ""
"Declared hook points: ``on_compact`` (``by=\"compact\"``, no ``match_on``) — the compaction observation / "
"interception point, dispatched by this module at the use site (whoever declares it dispatches it)."

#: flowing.composables.compact:51 of
msgid ""
"挂载的钩子：``after_provider_gen[\"_turn\"]`` 检测与换链 handler "
"（``by=\"compact\"``，pattern 注册：``match_on=\"by\"``，字面量 ``\"_turn\"`` "
"精确匹配主回合来源）。``remove_by_owner(\"compact\")`` 可 整组移除（``on_compact`` "
"钩子点属声明而非 handler，不受移除影响）。"
msgstr ""
"Mounted hooks: the ``after_provider_gen[\"_turn\"]`` detection-and-chain-swap handler "
"(``by=\"compact\"``, pattern registration: ``match_on=\"by\"``, the literal ``\"_turn\"`` exactly matches "
"the main-turn source). ``remove_by_owner(\"compact\")`` removes the whole set (the ``on_compact`` hook "
"point is a declaration, not a handler, and is unaffected by removal)."

#: flowing.composables.compact:55 of
msgid "作用域：只影响调用它的那一个 Agent 实例；不修改 ``agent.model``、 不动消息队列、不 abort 回合、不持久化任何压缩状态。"
msgstr "Scope: only affects the one Agent instance that calls it; does not modify ``agent.model``, does not touch the message queue, does not abort the turn, and does not persist any compaction state."

#: flowing.composables.compact:71 of
msgid ""
"递归防护：检测 handler 经 ``after_provider_gen[\"_turn\"]`` pattern 注册，副线（含压缩自身的 "
"``side_query``）与其余来源在 dispatch 层被 过滤、根本不分发到本 handler——防护不依赖任何状态。"
msgstr ""
"Recursion protection: the detection handler is registered via the ``after_provider_gen[\"_turn\"]`` "
"pattern; side channels (including the compaction's own ``side_query``) and other sources are filtered at "
"the dispatch layer and never reach this handler — the protection depends on no state."

#: flowing.composables.compact:74 of
msgid ""
"触发条件：``usage_ratio > threshold`` （严格大于）；模型未声明 ``context_window`` "
"（``usage_ratio is None``）时永不触发——不可测则 不动作。"
msgstr ""
"Trigger condition: ``usage_ratio > threshold`` (strictly greater); it never triggers when the model does "
"not declare ``context_window`` (``usage_ratio is None``) — no action when it cannot be measured."

#: flowing.composables.compact:77 of
msgid "压缩对回合透明：不 abort、不占用消息队列、不在旧链追加任何压缩相关 消息；被压缩的任务不感知压缩发生。"
msgstr "Compaction is transparent to the turn: no abort, no occupation of the message queue, no compaction-related messages appended to the old chain; the compacted task does not perceive the compaction."

#: flowing.composables.compact:79 of
msgid ""
"旧链物理完整保留（append-only：压缩不写删除标记、不做树手术）；新根 ``parent_id is "
"None``、``kind=SYSTEM``、``source=\"compact\"``。"
msgstr ""
"The old chain is physically kept intact (append-only: compaction writes no deletion markers and performs "
"no tree surgery); the new root has ``parent_id is None``, ``kind=SYSTEM``, ``source=\"compact\"``."

#: flowing.composables.compact:84 of
msgid ""
":func:`flowing.composables.retry.use_retry` —— 另一个内置 Composable（同构形态）。 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.estimate_context_tokens` —— 阈值检测的 数据源。 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.side_query` —— 摘要的副线调用通道。 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.fork` —— 换链的视角切换通道。 "
":meth:`flowing.message.MessageChain.branch` —— ``None`` 开新根的 持久化入口。"
msgstr ""
":func:`flowing.composables.retry.use_retry` —— another builtin Composable (isomorphic form). "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.estimate_context_tokens` —— the data source for threshold detection. "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.side_query` —— the side-channel call used for summarization. "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.fork` —— the view-switching channel for the chain swap. "
":meth:`flowing.message.MessageChain.branch` —— the persistence entry point for opening a new root with ``None``."

#: flowing.composables.compact.DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT:1 of
msgid "默认压缩指令（``compact_prompt`` 的缺省值）。"
msgstr "The default compaction instruction (the default value of ``compact_prompt``)."

#: flowing.composables.compact.DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT:3 of
msgid "要求模型把当前对话压缩为一份结构化交接摘要（目标 / 进展 / 关键决策 / 后续步骤 / 关键上下文五节），供上下文被清空后无缝继续当前任务。"
msgstr "Asks the model to compress the current conversation into a structured handoff summary (five sections: goal / progress / key decisions / next steps / key context), so the current task can continue seamlessly after the context is cleared."

#: flowing.composables.compact.DEFAULT_COMPACT_PROMPT:6 of
msgid ""
"行为边界：仅在 Agent 上尚无 ``compact_prompt`` 属性时由 ``use_compact`` "
"绑定为实例属性（开发者已定义的优先，不覆盖）；这是策略的一部分，随 ``use_compact`` 整体可被替换。"
msgstr ""
"Behavioral boundary: bound as an instance attribute by ``use_compact`` only when the Agent does not yet "
"have a ``compact_prompt`` attribute (a developer-defined value takes precedence and is not overwritten); "
"this is part of the policy and is replaceable together with ``use_compact`` as a whole."

#: ../../api/flowing.composables.rst:21
msgid "flowing.composables.reminder module"
msgstr "flowing.composables.reminder module"

#: flowing.composables.reminder:1 of
msgid "flowing.composables.reminder —— 内置系统提醒 Composable（可选、非默认）。"
msgstr "flowing.composables.reminder —— the builtin system-reminder Composable (optional, non-default)."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块提供 ``use_system_reminder()``：为单个 Agent 实例启用「每个逻辑 Turn "
"开始前注入系统提醒」策略。启用后，每个逻辑 Turn 开始时，默认策略 把当前可见的提醒内容清单压缩为一条 "
"``Message(kind=EVENT, ...)`` （多个 内容块合并成一条消息），经 ``before_turn`` "
"钩子附加进本回合的待挂树 批次——提醒随批次挂树并持久化，排在触发消息之后。"
msgstr ""
"This module provides ``use_system_reminder()``: it enables the \"inject a system reminder before each "
"logical Turn starts\" policy on a single Agent instance. Once enabled, at the start of each logical Turn "
"the default policy compresses the currently visible reminder contents into one ``Message(kind=EVENT, "
"...)`` (multiple content blocks merged into one message), appended via the ``before_turn`` hook into this "
"turn's pending batch — the reminder is attached to the tree and persisted along with the batch, after the "
"triggering message."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:11 of
msgid ""
"典型内容：当前时间、当前目录、任务状态等高频率更新的值。它们不应进 prompt 块（破坏 Provider 前缀缓存，见 "
"``flowing.context`` 模块 docstring）；消息通道（历史尾部追加）是正确位置。"
msgstr ""
"Typical contents: frequently updated values such as the current time, current directory, and task status. "
"They should not go into prompt blocks (which would break the Provider prefix cache; see the "
"``flowing.context`` module docstring); the message channel (appended at the history tail) is the right "
"place."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:15 of
msgid ""
"本模块属应用层 / 内置 Composable：随 ``flowing`` 包发布但不自动启用， 必须由 Agent 开发者在 "
"``setup()`` 中显式调用。不调用的 Agent 不持有 任何提醒相关 handler 与状态。"
msgstr ""
"This module belongs to the application layer / builtin Composables: it ships with the ``flowing`` package "
"but is not enabled automatically; the Agent developer must call it explicitly in ``setup()``. An Agent "
"that never calls it holds no reminder-related handlers or state."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:21 of
msgid ""
"启用方式：仅阶段二——``setup()`` 中调用 ``use_system_reminder(self)`` （恢复时 ``setup()``"
" 在新实例上执行，天然不叠加）。未启用时零开销： ``before_turn`` / ``after_turn`` 链上无任何 ``by"
"=\"system-reminder\"`` handler。"
msgstr ""
"How to enable: stage two only — call ``use_system_reminder(self)`` in ``setup()`` (on recovery "
"``setup()`` runs on the new instance, so nothing stacks up naturally). Zero overhead when not enabled: no "
"``by=\"system-reminder\"`` handler on the ``before_turn`` / ``after_turn`` chains."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:25 of
msgid "注册的资源：无 provide key、无工具注册、无 Agent 状态键、不改 prompt 块。"
msgstr "Registered resources: no provide keys, no tool registrations, no Agent state keys, no prompt-block changes."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:27 of
msgid "声明的钩子点：无（本模块只往核心已有的钩子点挂 handler，纯挂载）。"
msgstr "Declared hook points: none (this module only mounts handlers onto existing core hook points — pure mounting)."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:28 of
msgid ""
"挂载的钩子：``before_turn`` 注入 handler（``by=\"system-reminder\"``， 见 "
":func:`use_system_reminder`）+ ``clean=True`` 时的 ``after_turn`` 清理 "
"handler（``by=\"system-reminder\"``）。两者共用 ``by``， ``remove_by_owner"
"(\"system-reminder\")`` 可整组移除。"
msgstr ""
"Mounted hooks: the ``before_turn`` injection handler (``by=\"system-reminder\"``, see "
":func:`use_system_reminder`) + the ``after_turn`` cleanup handler when ``clean=True`` "
"(``by=\"system-reminder\"``). The two share the same ``by``; ``remove_by_owner(\"system-reminder\")`` "
"removes the whole set."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:32 of
msgid "作用域：只影响调用它的那一个 Agent 实例；注入的提醒随批次落盘 （``clean=False`` 时持久化、崩溃可恢复），间隔判定状态不落盘。"
msgstr "Scope: only affects the one Agent instance that calls it; injected reminders are persisted with the batch (with ``clean=False`` they are persisted and recoverable after a crash); the interval-decision state is not persisted."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:48 of
msgid ""
"注入形态：每个满足注入条件的逻辑 Turn 压缩为一条 ``Message``—— ``kind=EVENT``、``source"
"=\"system-reminder\"``、 ``tags=[\"system-reminder\"]``，内容为多个 "
"``TextBlock`` 合并——附加到 ``pending_messages`` 末尾（排在触发消息之后），随批次挂树并持久化。"
msgstr ""
"Injection form: each logical Turn that meets the injection condition gets one ``Message`` — "
"``kind=EVENT``, ``source=\"system-reminder\"``, ``tags=[\"system-reminder\"]``, whose content is multiple "
"merged ``TextBlock``s — appended to the end of ``pending_messages`` (after the triggering message), "
"attached to the tree and persisted along with the batch."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:52 of
msgid ""
"内容求值：``contents`` 各项为 ``(agent) -> str`` 回调或静态字符串， "
"每次注入现场求值；空字符串条目剔除；清单为空（含缺省 ``None``）或 全部条目为空串时本回合不注入。"
msgstr ""
"Content evaluation: each item of ``contents`` is an ``(agent) -> str`` callback or a static string, "
"evaluated on the spot at each injection; empty-string entries are dropped; when the list is empty "
"(including the default ``None``) or all entries are empty strings, nothing is injected this turn."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:55 of
msgid ""
"间隔判定：``message_interval`` 与 ``time_interval`` 是与关系——任一 不满足即跳过（默认两者均为 "
"0：每回合都注入）；首次注入不受间隔限制。"
msgstr ""
"Interval decision: ``message_interval`` and ``time_interval`` are conjunctive — if either is unmet, "
"injection is skipped (by default both are 0: inject every turn); the first injection is not subject to the "
"interval limits."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:57 of
msgid ""
"清理语义：``clean=True`` 时每回合收尾按 ``tags`` 擦除本回合注入的 提醒（head 回退由 Agent "
"层处理）——代价是每回合收尾都擦除一次（写 盘量约翻倍），且清理后历史回放中该信息丢失（崩溃恢复后那条提醒 "
"已被删除）。``clean=False`` （默认）时提醒留在树上。"
msgstr ""
"Cleanup semantics: with ``clean=True``, this turn's injected reminders are erased by ``tags`` at the end "
"of each turn (the head rollback is handled by the Agent layer) — the cost is one erasure at every turn end "
"(write volume roughly doubles), and after cleanup the information is lost from history replay (after crash "
"recovery that reminder has been deleted). With ``clean=False`` (default), the reminders stay on the tree."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:61 of
msgid "与批次同生共死：``before_turn`` 被 ``Intercepted`` 阻断时整个批次 丢弃、不落盘，提醒随之不注入（同批次语义）。"
msgstr "Living and dying with the batch: when ``before_turn`` is blocked by ``Intercepted``, the whole batch is discarded without persistence, and the reminder is not injected along with it (same-batch semantics)."

#: flowing.composables.reminder:66 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` —— ``pending_messages`` 附加式 注入的载体。 "
":func:`flowing.composables.retry.use_retry` —— 同构的安装模式。"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` —— the carrier of ``pending_messages`` append-style injection. "
":func:`flowing.composables.retry.use_retry` —— an isomorphic installation pattern."

#: ../../api/flowing.composables.rst:29
msgid "flowing.composables.retry module"
msgstr "flowing.composables.retry module"

#: flowing.composables.retry:1 of
msgid "flowing.composables.retry —— 内置重试 Composable（可选、非默认）。"
msgstr "flowing.composables.retry —— the builtin retry Composable (optional, non-default)."

#: flowing.composables.retry:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块提供 ``use_retry()``：为单个 Agent 实例启用「LLM 调用失败退避 重试」策略。启用后，该 Agent 的 LLM "
"调用抛出可重试类异常时，默认策略 按参数指定的退避模型等待一段时间（期间不调用 LLM），再在同一回合内 "
"重发调用，直至成功或达到次数上限；抛出不可重试类错误与未知错误时不做 重试，本回合以错误结局终止。"
msgstr ""
"This module provides ``use_retry()``: it enables the \"backoff retry on LLM call failure\" policy on a "
"single Agent instance. Once enabled, when this Agent's LLM call raises a retryable exception, the default "
"policy waits according to the backoff model given by the parameters (no LLM call during the wait), then "
"re-issues the call within the same turn, until success or the retry limit; non-retryable and unknown "
"errors are not retried, and the turn terminates with an error outcome."

#: flowing.composables.retry:11 of
msgid ""
"本模块属应用层 / 内置 Composable：随 ``flowing`` 包发布但不自动启用， 必须由 Agent 开发者在 "
"``setup()`` 中显式调用 ``use_retry(self)``。不 调用的 Agent 不持有任何重试相关状态、不注册任何 "
"handler——错误路径与 不调用时逐字节等价（LLM 异常 → ``on_provider_error`` 空链分发 → "
"``can_continue`` 保持 ``False`` → 本回合以 ``\"error\"`` 结局终止， Agent 存活）。"
msgstr ""
"This module belongs to the application layer / builtin Composables: it ships with the ``flowing`` package "
"but is not enabled automatically; the Agent developer must call ``use_retry(self)`` explicitly in "
"``setup()``. An Agent that never calls it holds no retry-related state and registers no handlers — the "
"error path is byte-for-byte equivalent to not calling it (LLM exception → empty-chain dispatch of "
"``on_provider_error`` → ``can_continue`` stays ``False`` → the turn terminates with a ``\"error\"`` "
"outcome, the Agent survives)."

#: flowing.composables.retry:18 of
msgid ""
"「重试」是策略不是机制：框架核心只提供错误分类（哪些类型可重试、 哪些不可重试，见 "
"``flowing.errors``）、``on_provider_error`` 钩子点的 分发与 ``can_continue`` "
"决策通道；「重试几次、等多久、对哪些错误重试」 全部由本模块提供一份可整体替换的默认实现。替换方式： "
"``remove_by_owner(\"retry\")`` 移除默认 handler 后自注册（见 :func:`use_retry` "
"使用示例）。"
msgstr ""
"\"Retry\" is a policy, not a mechanism: the framework core provides only error classification (which types "
"are retryable and which are not, see ``flowing.errors``), the dispatch of the ``on_provider_error`` hook "
"point, and the ``can_continue`` decision channel; \"how many times to retry, how long to wait, and which "
"errors to retry\" are all provided by this module as one default implementation replaceable as a whole. "
"Replacement method: remove the default handlers with ``remove_by_owner(\"retry\")`` and register your own "
"(see the :func:`use_retry` examples)."

#: flowing.composables.retry:27 of
msgid ""
"启用方式：仅阶段二——``setup()`` 中调用 ``use_retry(self)`` （恢复 时 ``setup()`` "
"在新实例上执行，天然不叠加）。未启用时零开销： ``on_provider_error`` / ``before_turn`` 链上无任何 "
"``by=\"retry\"`` handler，``on_retry`` 钩子点不存在（访问抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`）。"
msgstr ""
"How to enable: stage two only — call ``use_retry(self)`` in ``setup()`` (on recovery ``setup()`` runs on "
"the new instance, so nothing stacks up naturally). Zero overhead when not enabled: no ``by=\"retry\"`` "
"handler on the ``on_provider_error`` / ``before_turn`` chains, and the ``on_retry`` hook point does not "
"exist (access raises :class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`)."

#: flowing.composables.retry:32 of
msgid "注册的资源：无 provide key、无工具注册、无 Agent 状态键。"
msgstr "Registered resources: no provide keys, no tool registrations, no Agent state keys."

#: flowing.composables.retry:33 of
msgid ""
"声明的钩子点：``on_retry`` （``by=\"retry\"``，无 ``match_on``）——重试 观测点，由本模块在使用处 "
"dispatch（谁声明谁 dispatch）。"
msgstr ""
"Declared hook points: ``on_retry`` (``by=\"retry\"``, no ``match_on``) — the retry observation point, "
"dispatched by this module at the use site (whoever declares it dispatches it)."

#: flowing.composables.retry:35 of
msgid ""
"挂载的钩子：``before_turn`` 归零 handler（``by=\"retry\"``，每个逻辑 Turn 开始重置重试计数）+ "
"``on_provider_error`` 重试决策 handler （``by=\"retry\"``）。两者共用 "
"``by=\"retry\"``， ``remove_by_owner(\"retry\")`` 可整组移除（``on_retry`` "
"钩子点属声明 而非 handler，不受移除影响）。"
msgstr ""
"Mounted hooks: the ``before_turn`` reset handler (``by=\"retry\"``, resets the retry counter at the start "
"of each logical Turn) + the ``on_provider_error`` retry-decision handler (``by=\"retry\"``). The two share "
"``by=\"retry\"``; ``remove_by_owner(\"retry\")`` removes the whole set (the ``on_retry`` hook point is a "
"declaration, not a handler, and is unaffected by removal)."

#: flowing.composables.retry:40 of
msgid "作用域：只影响调用它的那一个 Agent 实例；不修改 ``agent.model``、 不产生任何消息、不持久化任何状态。"
msgstr "Scope: only affects the one Agent instance that calls it; does not modify ``agent.model``, produces no messages, and persists no state."

#: flowing.composables.retry:56 of
msgid ""
"错误分类：默认策略只对 :data:`RETRYABLE_ERRORS` 中列出的四种异常 "
"重试；:data:`NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS` 中列出的异常与一切未知异常一律 "
"不重试（凭证错误不会因等待而变对，请求体不会因等待而合法）。"
msgstr ""
"Error classification: the default policy retries only the four exception types listed in "
":data:`RETRYABLE_ERRORS`; exceptions listed in :data:`NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS` and all unknown exceptions are "
"never retried (a credential error does not become right by waiting, and a request body does not become "
"valid by waiting)."

#: flowing.composables.retry:59 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError` 与其它调用期异常一样经 "
"``on_provider_error`` 分发；默认策略对它不重试（原样重发必然重现）， 压缩历史 / 换模型由用户 handler 自行实现。"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError` is dispatched via ``on_provider_error`` like other call-time "
"exceptions; the default policy does not retry it (re-sending as-is would necessarily reproduce it); "
"compacting history / switching models is left to user handlers."

#: flowing.composables.retry:62 of
msgid "重试发生在逻辑 Turn 内部：不产生任何消息、不写消息级树；重试计数 随 Turn 边界归零、不落盘、崩溃后不恢复。"
msgstr "Retries happen inside a logical Turn: they produce no messages and write nothing to the message tree; the retry counter resets at Turn boundaries, is not persisted, and is not recovered after a crash."

#: flowing.composables.retry:64 of
msgid "同一 Turn 内的多次 ``provider_gen()`` 共享同一重试预算（失败预算不 区分是哪一次调用消耗的）。"
msgstr "Multiple ``provider_gen()`` calls within the same Turn share the same retry budget (the failure budget does not distinguish which call consumed it)."

#: flowing.composables.retry:69 of
msgid ""
":func:`flowing.composables.compact.use_compact` —— 另一个内置 "
"Composable（同构形态）。 :class:`flowing.agent.ProviderErrorContext` —— 决策 "
"handler 的 value 类型与 ``can_continue`` 决策字段。 "
":class:`flowing.hooks.HookRegistry` —— ``on_provider_error`` / "
"``before_turn`` 钩子点的容器。 :class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` —— 逻辑 Turn "
"的执行期载体。"
msgstr ""
":func:`flowing.composables.compact.use_compact` —— another builtin Composable (isomorphic form). "
":class:`flowing.agent.ProviderErrorContext` —— the value type of the decision handler and the "
"``can_continue`` decision field. :class:`flowing.hooks.HookRegistry` —— the container of the "
"``on_provider_error`` / ``before_turn`` hook points. :class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` —— the "
"execution-time carrier of a logical Turn."

#: flowing.composables.retry.MAX_RETRY_DELAY:1 of
msgid "单次退避等待的时长上限（秒）。"
msgstr "The upper bound (in seconds) of a single backoff wait."

#: flowing.composables.retry.MAX_RETRY_DELAY:3 of
msgid ""
"默认策略计算出的任意一次等待时长（``asyncio.sleep`` 的参数）都不超过 该值——指数退避按 2 "
"的幂增长时尤其如此：超过一分钟的等待对单机小工具 定位没有价值，反而让回合看起来像挂起。"
msgstr ""
"No wait duration computed by the default policy (the argument to ``asyncio.sleep``) exceeds this value — "
"especially when exponential backoff grows by powers of 2: waits longer than a minute have no value for the "
"single-machine small-tool positioning and only make the turn look hung."

#: flowing.composables.retry.MAX_RETRY_DELAY:7 of
msgid ""
"这是策略的一部分，随 ``use_retry`` 整体可被替换，不属框架核心机制； 只约束默认 handler，用户自注册的 "
"``on_provider_error`` handler 不受此 值限制。"
msgstr ""
"This is part of the policy, replaceable together with ``use_retry`` as a whole, and not a framework core "
"mechanism; it constrains only the default handler — user-registered ``on_provider_error`` handlers are not "
"bound by this value."

#: flowing.composables.retry.MAX_RETRY_DELAY:11 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.composables.retry.use_retry`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.composables.retry.use_retry`"

#: flowing.composables.retry.RETRYABLE_ERRORS:1 of
msgid "默认策略视为可重试的异常类型元组（「限流 + 基础设施瞬时故障」四类）。"
msgstr "The tuple of exception types the default policy treats as retryable (four kinds: \"rate limiting + transient infrastructure failures\")."

#: flowing.composables.retry.RETRYABLE_ERRORS:3 of
msgid ""
"分别是 :class:`flowing.errors.RateLimitedError` （限流）、 "
":class:`flowing.errors.ServerError` （服务端错误）、 "
":class:`flowing.errors.NetworkError` （网络故障）与 "
":class:`flowing.errors.ProviderTimeoutError` （Provider 超时）。"
msgstr ""
"They are :class:`flowing.errors.RateLimitedError` (rate limiting), :class:`flowing.errors.ServerError` "
"(server error), :class:`flowing.errors.NetworkError` (network failure), and "
":class:`flowing.errors.ProviderTimeoutError` (Provider timeout)."

#: flowing.composables.retry.RETRYABLE_ERRORS:8 of
msgid ""
"这是策略清单而非机制清单：机制只保证这些类型在对应故障时被 Provider adapter 抛出、且会经过 "
"``on_provider_error`` 分发；「对它们重试」是 ``use_retry`` 的选择，用户 handler "
"可自由采用不同清单。不在此元组中的 异常类型（含一切未知异常）默认策略一律不重试。"
msgstr ""
"This is a policy list, not a mechanism list: the mechanism only guarantees that these types are raised by "
"the Provider adapter on the corresponding failures and pass through ``on_provider_error`` dispatch; "
"\"retrying them\" is ``use_retry``'s choice, and user handlers are free to adopt different lists. "
"Exception types not in this tuple (including all unknown exceptions) are never retried by the default "
"policy."

#: flowing.composables.retry.RETRYABLE_ERRORS:13 of
msgid ":data:`flowing.composables.retry.NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS`"
msgstr ":data:`flowing.composables.retry.NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS`"

#: flowing.composables.retry.NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS:1 of
msgid "默认策略显式不重试的异常类型元组（凭证类、请求类、配额类与长度类错误）。"
msgstr "The tuple of exception types the default policy explicitly does not retry (credential, request, quota, and length errors)."

#: flowing.composables.retry.NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS:3 of
msgid ""
"分别是 :class:`flowing.errors.AuthenticationError`、 "
":class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError`、 "
":class:`flowing.errors.ContentPolicyError`、 "
":class:`flowing.errors.InvalidRequestError`、 "
":class:`flowing.errors.QuotaExhaustedError` 与 "
":class:`flowing.errors.RequestTooLargeError`。"
msgstr ""
"They are :class:`flowing.errors.AuthenticationError`, :class:`flowing.errors.ContextLengthError`, "
":class:`flowing.errors.ContentPolicyError`, :class:`flowing.errors.InvalidRequestError`, "
":class:`flowing.errors.QuotaExhaustedError`, and :class:`flowing.errors.RequestTooLargeError`."

#: flowing.composables.retry.NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS:10 of
msgid ""
"这些异常到达默认 handler 时被原样放行：不等待、不计数、不改写任何 字段，``can_continue`` 保持 "
"``False``，本回合以错误结局终止——重试 它们不改变结果（凭证不会因等待而变对，请求体不会因等待而合法，余额 "
"不会因等待而变多，上下文不会因等待而变短）。``ContextLengthError`` 的 恢复（压缩历史 / 换大窗模型）由用户 "
"handler 自行实现，默认策略不涵盖。"
msgstr ""
"When these exceptions reach the default handler they pass through unchanged: no wait, no counting, no "
"field rewriting, ``can_continue`` stays ``False``, and the turn terminates with an error outcome — "
"retrying them does not change the result (credentials do not become right by waiting, a request body does "
"not become valid by waiting, balance does not grow by waiting, and context does not shrink by waiting). "
"Recovery from ``ContextLengthError`` (compacting history / switching to a larger-window model) is left to "
"user handlers and is not covered by the default policy."

#: flowing.composables.retry.NON_RETRYABLE_ERRORS:16 of
msgid ":data:`flowing.composables.retry.RETRYABLE_ERRORS`"
msgstr ":data:`flowing.composables.retry.RETRYABLE_ERRORS`"
